    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Authentic Sangokushi strategy board game</h2>This game is a strategy board game set in the Romance of the Three Kingdoms.<br>Victory is achieved by taking the headquarters or defeating a unit (piece) with a military commander.<br>Command a variety of units with different abilities and aim for victory!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096380/extras/fb7060d32fce43f6fbc4789a7b68457f.avif?t=1753346995\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight strong opponents in online battles!</h2>This game supports online battles.<br>Enjoy playing against players from all over the world!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096380/extras/77b29ec70fd8a22ef167b02b0675247e.avif?t=1753346995\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Form a formation considering offense and defense!</h2>Before the battle, you can freely arrange various pieces and form a formation.<br>The key to victory is to think about the balance between offense and defense and form a formation.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096380/extras/f4559ff68df5d8eb41ff6eb9dca24a5d.avif?t=1753346995\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A big damage attack from behind the piece!</h2>Pieces are vulnerable to attacks from behind.<br>It is also an important strategy to take advantage of mobility and attack from the side or from behind.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096380/extras/9aecb822643093087be716e9d2458121.avif?t=1753346995\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Summon a warlord using the Warlord Souls! Collect beautiful warlord cards!</h2>You can get Warlord Souls by winning battles or by making purchases.<br>You can summon new warlords by using warlord souls.<br>Collect unique military commander cards and use them properly in battle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096380/extras/bc53aae8b2247e8af236694a81338aaa.avif?t=1753346995\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Purchase weapons and schemes with rewards!</h2>If you win the battle, you will get &quot;Wu Zhu Coin&quot;.<br>If you go to the store, you can buy weapons and schemes for Wu Zhu Coin.<br>Make full use of weapons and strategies to advance the battlefield more favorably.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096380/extras/f53da3332a6e6b9d8447f768cccbe032.avif?t=1753346995\" /></div>",
